{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>And they came to Marah.</b> It is written ויסעו מים סוף (Numbers 33:11 [LXX]) — like ויסע משה את ישראל מים סוף וילכו דרך שלשת ימים במדבר איתם ויחנו במרה (there [in the same chapter], v. 8 [LXX])." "<b>Therefore one called its name.</b> 'One called' is like אשר ילדה אותה ללוי (Numbers 26:59)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {0 "The citation 'במד״ ל״ג י״א' (Numbers 33:11) does not match the MT verse numbering; the MT has no such itinerary verse at 33:11. The quoted verse beginning 'ויסע משה' is not found in MT Numbers 33 at all. Translated the citation and the cross-reference as they stand in the Hebrew."}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:34:52.191778472Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}